    <briefdescription>
<para>Verifies that the filesystem hosting <computeroutput>path</computeroutput> has at least <computeroutput>required_bytes</computeroutput> bytes of free space. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Per module FUTURE_ENHANCEMENTS.md the check must confirm ≥ 2× the bundle size of free space before starting a download to prevent mid-install exhaustion. The caller should therefore pass <computeroutput>2</computeroutput> * bundle_size as <computeroutput>required_bytes</computeroutput>.</para>
<para>The <computeroutput>space_provider</computeroutput> callback is injected so that unit tests can exercise both the pass and fail paths without touching the real filesystem. The default provider uses <computeroutput>std::filesystem::space()</computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
